{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近リア充してるまぁやです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって、今日は幕張メッセにて握手会でしたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イェイ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑個別の時の服"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝から来てくださりありがとーございますー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄く楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりでなんか緊張した"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも来てくれる方へ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔見ると安心と\n「あ〜来てくれた〜!!嬉しいー!!」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなっちゃいます\n本当に大切な人ばかりだから...\nありがとう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじめての方へ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃくちゃ嬉しいー!!\n楽しんで帰ってくれたかな〜？\n喜んでもらえたかな〜？\n来てくれてありがとう♪\nまあや族さん達が仲良くなれたら嬉しいな〜♪\n優しい人ばかりだから♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子のまあや族さんへ...\n来てくれてありがとう♪\n今日の服装はどうだったかな？\n女の子のまあや族さんもめちゃくちゃ嬉しいです!!\nありがとう〜!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はこれなかったまあや族さんへ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行けないけど頑張って！\nの応援の言葉にはいつも元気をもらってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやからも、ありがとうパワーが届いていますように♪\nありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんで握手会終わってから川後ひなちゃんと浅草行ったの〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歩き回ってめっちゃ食べた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちゃんとはこの前もパンケーキ食べに行った"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでこの前は学校から帰って洗濯物してたらいきなり能條ちゃんから電話きて、\n『♪今すぐ渋谷にきて』\nって言われて、\n『今洗濯物してるしぃ......』\nってゆーと\n『いや、早く早く、おいで』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っと言われ、ノリで急いで準備していきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"するとチームN(ちーちゃん、あすかちゃん、あみちゃん)と合流してピザ食べたり、プリクラとったりして遊んだりしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで、お話ししてたら\nあみちゃんが\n『まぁや家泊まりたい〜』\nって言って、なんかノリで泊まることになり急遽来ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ洗濯物の途中だったので少し散らかってました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"DVDみたりお話したりした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の日もゆっくりして、夜、ちーちゃんとあすかちゃんは帰ったんだけど、アミアミは\n『もうちょっとゆっくりして帰る〜』\nっとかいって、結局泊まっていきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも次の日学校だったので、同じ時間に家を出ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またきてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから〜シャチハタの印鑑の事教えてくれてありがとうございました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早速、見に行ったよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なるほど！これが...シャチハタなんだね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詳しく教えてもらったから勉強になりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと〜...前回のコメントの中に、まあやはダンミツじゃなくて、\nあんみつ姫だね！\nってあったけど...あんみつ姫を調べてみるね..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"汗汗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかくリア充してます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20日は皆さん握手会来てくださいますか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お留守番ですか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#なんかわかんないけど写メ一枚でもうサイズオーバーではれませんでした！\nごめんね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/03/16/3766853/0002.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}